Description: A discrete event simulation model estimating the costs, QALYs
    and clinical outcomes of breast cancer screening strategies, including
    risk-stratified screening, for women in the UK. Originally published in
    Gray et al. (2017), Value in Health 20:1100-1109. Subsequently updated 
    in Wright et al. (2026). Cancer Epidemiologiy, Biomarkers and Prevention.
